  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/a_tree)\n\nOne hot summer day. Yeo-Woon, a retraining student, meets Cha-Hyeon, a mysterious man in the countryside who came down as if to escape.  He extremely avoids contact with the outside world of her.  However, he seems to have scars that I can't tell where, so I keep wondering about him, and I'm concerned that he resembles someone.  Will Cha-Hyeon really open the door to Yeo-Woon, who approaches Yeo-Woon slowly, showing interest and comfort...?!",
